ta-end=\"635\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Key Features:</span></p><p></p><ul data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"923\"><li data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"692\"><p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"692\">High-quality Swiss Lawn fabric – breathable &amp; soft</p></li><li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"742\"><p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"742\">Printed front &amp; daman for a chic, modern vibe</p></li><li data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"781\"><p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"781\">Plain back for an elegant contrast</p></li><li data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"842\"><p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"842\">Multicolor design suitable for casual &amp; semi-formal wear</p></li><li data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"895\"><p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"895\">2.25-yard shirt cutting for customized stitching</p></li><li data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"923\"><p data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"923\">Includes:&nbsp;<span data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"921\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">1 x Shirt</span></p></li></ul><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"983\"><br><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-filename=\"MZ117620013SHKLFS-media-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><br></p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/1%20Pc%20Women\'s%20Unstitched%20Swiss%20Lawn%20Printed%20Shirt/400030</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL);
