(66, 'Unstitched 3-Piece Lawn Suit with All-Over Print in Lilac Purple', 'unstitched-3-piece-lawn-suit-with-all-over-print-in-lilac-purple', '3200.00', NULL, '3700.00', '2025-08-20 14:11:15', '2025-08-20 14:11:15', 5, 5, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Lawn</div><div>• Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Shirt Front Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Neckline: Printed</div><div>• Sleeves Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Daman: Printed</div><div>• Shirt Back Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Trouser Fabric: Lawn</div><div>• Trouser Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Dupatta Fabric: Chiffon</div><div>• Dupatta Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 3 Pcs</div><div>• Package Includes: 1 x Shirt, 1 x Trouser, 1 x Dupatta</div><div>• Shirt Cutting: 3 Meter</div><div>• Trouser Cutting: 2.5 Meter</div><div>• Dupatta Cutting: 2.5 Meter</div><div>• Color: Purple</div></div><div>• <b>Note</b>: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div></div></div><div><br></div>', '<p>Discover the vibrant charm of this 3-piece unstitched Lawn printed suit, a perfect blend of contemporary style and effortless comfort. Crafted from premium Lawn fabric, the 3-meter shirt boasts a stunning all-over print, adorning the front, neckline, sleeves, daman, and back with intricate patterns that exude elegance. The 2.5-meter Lawn trouser features a complementary print, ensuring a cohesive and polished look. The 2.5-meter Chiffon dupatta, with its delicate printed design, adds a breezy, sophisticated touch to the ensemble, perfect for draping with grace.</p><p>This unstitched suit offers endless styling possibilities—tailor it into a traditional shalwar kameez, a modern straight-cut kurta, or chic cigarette pants t