(67, 'Women’s Jacquard 3-Piece Printed Suit with Chiffon Dupatta in Platinum', 'womens-jacquard-3-piece-printed-suit-with-chiffon-dupatta-in-platinum', '3700.00', NULL, '4400.00', '2025-08-20 14:14:20', '2025-08-20 14:14:20', 5, 5, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Jacquard</div><div>• Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Shirt Front Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Neckline: Printed</div><div>• Sleeves Pattern: Plain</div><div>• Daman: Printed</div><div>• Trouser Fabric: Jacquard</div><div>• Trouser Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Dupatta Fabric: Chiffon</div><div>• Dupatta Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 3 Pcs</div><div>• Package Includes: 1 x Shirt, 1 x Trouser, 1 x Dupatta</div><div>• Shirt Cutting: 2.5 Meter</div><div>• Trouser Cutting: 2.5 Meter</div><div>• Dupatta Cutting: 3 Meter</div><div>• Color: Silver</div></div><div>• <b>Note</b>: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div></div></div><div><br></div>', '<p>Embrace understated elegance with this 3-piece unstitched Jacquard printed suit, designed to combine luxurious texture with modern sophistication. Crafted from premium <b>Jacquard</b> fabric, the 2.5-meter shirt features a captivating printed pattern on the front, neckline, and daman, with plain sleeves for a refined contrast. The 2.5-meter Jacquard trouser, adorned with a <b>complementary</b> print, ensures a cohesive and stylish look. The 3-meter Chiffon dupatta, with its intricate printed design, adds a lightweight, graceful touch, perfect for elevating your ensemble.</p><p>This unstitched suit offers versatile styling options—tailor it into a classic <b>shalwar kameez</b>, a sleek kurta, or contemporary cigarette pants to reflect your uniqu