(71, '3 Pieces Women\'s Unstitched Digital Print Suit', '3-pieces-womens-unstitched-digital-print-suit', '3600.00', NULL, '4100.00', '2025-08-21 16:33:00', '2025-08-21 16:33:00', 5, 5, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Lawn</div><div>• Pattern: Digital Print</div><div>• Shirt Front Pattern: Digital Print</div><div>• Neckline: Printed</div><div>• Sleeves Pattern: Digital Print</div><div>• Daman: Printed</div><div>• Shirt Back Pattern: Digital Print</div><div>• Trouser Fabric: Lawn</div><div>• Trouser Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Dupatta Fabric: Diamond</div><div>• Dupatta Pattern: Digital Print</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 3 Pcs</div><div>• Package Includes: 1 x Shirt, 1 x Trouser, 1 x Dupatta</div><div>• Shirt Cutting: 3.25 Meter</div><div>• Trouser Cutting: 2.25 Meter</div><div>• Dupatta Cutting: 2.25 Meter</div><div>• Color: Grey</div></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div></div></div><div><br></div>', '<p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"730\">Step into timeless elegance with this 3-piece unstitched Lawn digital printed suit in a sophisticated grey tone. The premium Lawn shirt features digital prints on the front, neckline, sleeves, daman, and back, creating a chic and cohesive look. Complemented with a printed Lawn trouser and a graceful Diamond digital printed dupatta, this outfit brings together comfort and style. Perfect for casual outings, festive wear, or semi-formal events, its breathable fabric ensures ease while the subtle grey shade adds modern charm to your wardrobe.</p><p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"751\">✨ Key Features:</strong></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><ul data-start=\"754\" data-end