(72, '3-Piece Unstitched Lawn Printed Suit – Yellow Elegance', '3-piece-unstitched-lawn-printed-suit-yellow-elegance', '3600.00', NULL, '4100.00', '2025-08-21 16:33:00', '2025-08-21 16:51:50', 5, 5, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div><div>Title: 3 Pcs Unstitched Lawn Printed Suit with Chiffon Dupatta - Yellow&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Description:&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>Brighten up your wardrobe with this stunning 3-piece unstitched lawn suit in a fresh yellow shade. Designed with premium quality lawn fabric, it features a fully printed shirt with detailed neckline, sleeves, and daman. The matching printed lawn trouser adds elegance, while the chiffon dupatta completes the look with a soft and graceful touch. Perfect for casual and semi-formal summer wear.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Key Features:&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Lawn&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Pattern: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Shirt Front Pattern: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Neckline: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Sleeves Pattern: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Daman: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Shirt Back Pattern: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Trouser Fabric: Lawn&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Trouser Pattern: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Dupatta Fabric: Chiffon&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Dupatta Pattern: Printed&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 3 Pcs&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Package Includes: 1 x Shirt, 1 x Trouser, 1 x Dupatta&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Shirt Cutting: 3 Meter&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Trouser Cutting: 2.5 Meter&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Dupatta Cutting: 2.5 Meter&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Color: Yellow&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></div><div><br></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div></div></div><div><br></div>', '<p>Celebrate vibrant style with this 3-piece unstitched Lawn printed suit, a dazzling fusion of color and contemporary design. Crafted from premium Lawn fabric, the 3-meter shirt showcases a lively multicolor print across the front, neckline, sleeves, daman, and back, creating a cohesive and eye-catching look. The 2.5-meter Lawn trouser features a complementary printed pattern, ensuring a harmonious ensemble. The 2.5-meter Chiffon dupatta, adorned with intricate multicolor prints, adds a breezy, elegant touch, perfect for making a bold statement.</p><p>This unstitched suit offers endless styling possibilities—tailor it into a traditional shalwar kameez, a chic straight-cut kurta, or trendy cigarette pants to suit your personal flair. The lightweight Lawn fabric ensures breathability and comfort, ideal for warm weather, while the flowing Chiffon dupatta enhances your elegance for casual outings, festive gatherings, or semi-formal events. With its vibrant multicolor palette, blending hues like coral, turquoise, mustard, and more, this suit is a versatile addition to any wardrobe.</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Key Features</span>:</p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Premium Fabrics</span>: Soft, breathable Lawn for shirt and trouser, paired with a lightweight Chiffon dupatta.</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Vibrant Prints</span>: All-over multicolor printed patterns on the shirt (front, neckline, sleeves, daman, back), trouser, and dupatta.</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Generous Cutting</span>: 3 meters for the shirt, 2.5 meters for the trouser, and 2.5 meters for the dupatta, offering ample fabric for customization.</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Versatile Styling</span>: Create traditional or modern outfits for any occasion.</li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Bold Aesthetic</span>: Multicolor design adds a lively, festive charm to your look.</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Note</span>: Due to manual measurements, there may be a 1-3 cm variation in cutting. Slight color differences may occur due to lighting or monitor effects, ensuring each piece is uniquely yours.</p><p></p><p>This 3-piece unstitched suit is perfect for the modern woman who embraces bold colors, comfort, and versatility. Pair it with your favorite accessories to craft a vibrant, personalized ensemble that stands out!</p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Unstitched%20Printed%20Suit/628385</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
(73, '3 Pcs Women\'s Unstitched Plain Suit', '3-pcs-womens-unstitched-plain-suit', '2500.00', NULL, '2900.00', '2025-08-21 16:38:15', '2025-08-21 16:38:15', 5, 5, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Khaddar&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Pattern: Plain with Mirror Work Neckline &amp; Calligraphy Daman&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Shirt Front &amp; Back: Plain&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Sleeves: Plain&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Trouser Fabric: Khaddar (Plain)&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Dupatta Fabric: Khaadi with Sequins Embroidery&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Number of Pieces: 3 Pcs (Shirt, Trouser, Dupatta)&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Cutting: Shirt 2.5m, Trouser 2.5m, Dupatta 2.5m&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Color: Green&nbsp; ✨ Product Description&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></div></div><div><div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div></div></div><div><br></div>', '<p>✨ Product Description&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>This 3-piece Khaddar suit is a timeless blend of elegance and comfort. Designed in a rich green shade, the shirt is kept plain for a classy look but enhanced with a mirror work neckline and calligraphy on the daman, giving it a unique artistic touch. The plain trouser balances the design, while the sequins embroidered Khaadi dupatta adds festive charm. Ideal for winter wear, casual gatherings, or semi-formal events.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>🔑 Key Features (Detailed)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Shirt Fabric: Premium quality Khaddar ensures durability, warmth, and comfort for everyday or occasional wear.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Pattern: Plain base with elegant details that allow versatile styling, from casual looks to accessorized formal wear.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Neckline: Beautiful mirror work neckline adds sparkle and highlights the shirt without needing extra embellishments.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Sleeves: Plain Khaddar sleeves keep the overall look minimal and comfortable.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Daman: Calligraphy design at the hemline brings a unique artistic and cultural touch to the outfit.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Shirt Back: Plain to maintain balance and elegance with the detailed front.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Trouser Fabric: Khaddar trouser in plain style, providing comfort and flexibility for all-day wear.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Dupatta: Khaadi fabric dupatta decorated with sequins embroidery, adding a festive and stylish finish to the outfit.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Number of Pieces: 3-piece suit including shirt, trouser, and dupatta for a complete outfit solution.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Cutting: Each piece has 2.5 meters of fabric, allowing customized stitching according to personal style.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Color: Elegant green shade, suitable for both daytime and evening wear.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div><br></div>', '<p>http://shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Unstitched%20Plain%20Suit/628416</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL);
