egance, and everyday wear.</p><p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"832\">The <strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"422\">round-neck shirt</strong> features a <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"463\">beautiful printed pattern</strong> on both the shirt and trousers, creating a cohesive and stylish look. With a <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"570\">shirt length of 38 inches</strong>, <strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"591\">chest 21 inches</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"621\">arm length 26 inches</strong>, it offers a comfortable and flattering fit. The <strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"692\">matching trousers</strong>, measuring <strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"727\">39 inches in length</strong> with a <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"757\">waist of 26 inches</strong> and <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"779\">hip 25 inches</strong>, complete the outfit with ease and sophistication.</p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"975\">Perfect for casual outings, festive occasions, or semi-formal gatherings, this stylish 2-piece set is a versatile addition to any wardrobe.</p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/2%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Swiss%20Lawn%20Printed%20Shirt%20And%20Trouser/621858</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
