.5 Yards</div></div></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div><div><br></div>', '<p>Step into elegance with this <strong data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"318\">luxury maroon Shamoz Silk embroidered 3-piece maxi outfit</strong>, crafted to perfection for weddings, parties, and festive gatherings. The <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"455\">front heavy embroidery with 8 bunches and lace border work</strong> enhances the royal look of the maxi, while the <strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"526\">embroidered trouser</strong> and <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"579\">2.5-yard chiffon dupatta with lace finishing</strong> complete this graceful ensemble.</p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Shamoz%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Frock/624123</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
(105, 'Premium Off White Digital Printed 2-Piece Lawn Cord Set – Stylish & Comfortable', 'premium-off-white-digital-printed-2-piece-lawn-cord-set-stylish-comfortable', '3300.00', NULL, '3800.00', '2025-08-22 15:59:02', '2025-08-22 15:59:02', 5, 6, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div>• Fabric: Lawn</div><div>• Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Neck Type: Round Neck</div><div>• Shirt Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Gown Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Trouser Fabric: Cotton Lawn</div><div>• Trouser Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Dupatta Fabric: Cotton</div><div>• Dupatta Pattern: Printed</div><div>• Available Sizes: Standard Size</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 2 Pcs</div><div>• Package Includes:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 1 x Shirt</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 1 x Trouser</div><div><br></div><div>• Gown Measurements:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Length: 38 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Chest: 21 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Shoulder: 26 Inches</div><div><br></div><div>• Shirt Measurements:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Length: 38 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Chest: 21 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Shoulder: 26 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Arm Length: 26 Inches</div><div><br></div><div>• Trouser Measurements:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Length: 40 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Waist: 40 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Hip: 27 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Flyper Length: 39/40 Inches</div><div><br></div><div>• Dupatta:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Dimensions: 2.5 Yards</div><div><br></div><div>• Color: Off White</div><div>• Design Details:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Digital Printed Cord Set</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Good Quality Stitching</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Full Suit Overlock</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Fabric: Silk (Premium Quality)</div><div><br></div><div>• Size Measurement:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Chest Size: 22 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Shirt Length: 37/38 Inches</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Trouser Length: 39/40 Inches</div></div></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div><div><br></div>', '<p>Upgrade your wardrobe with this <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"297\">premium digital printed 2-piece cord set</strong> in an elegant off-white shade. Designed with <strong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"386\">high-quality lawn and silk blend fabric</strong>, this outfit ensures both comfort and style. The <strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"464\">round-neck printed shirt</strong> paired with a <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"507\">matching printed trouser</strong> creates a chic, coordinated look for casual and semi-formal wear.</p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Lawn%20Printed%20Suit/623075</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL);
