(107, 'Stylish Grey Jersey Plain Coat – 1 Piece Standard Size', 'stylish-grey-jersey-plain-coat-1-piece-standard-size', '800.00', NULL, '1500.00', '2025-08-22 16:03:13', '2025-08-22 16:03:13', 5, 6, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Jersey</div><div>• Pattern: Plain</div><div>• Neck Type: Round Neck</div><div>• Available Sizes: Standard Size</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 1 Pc</div><div>• Package Includes:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 1 x Coat</div><div>• Color: Grey</div></div></div><div><br></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div><div><br></div>', '<p>Stay effortlessly stylish with this <strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"231\">plain grey jersey coat</strong>, designed for both comfort and elegance. Crafted from <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"308\">soft jersey fabric</strong>, it features a <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"345\">round neck design</strong> and comes in a <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"378\">standard size</strong>, making it a versatile addition to your wardrobe. Perfect for layering over casual or semi-formal outfits.</p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/1%20Pc%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Plain%20Overcoat/533256</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
