(110, 'Beige Fleece Collared Coat – Standard Size | Winter Collection', 'beige-fleece-collared-coat-standard-size-winter-collection', '2890.00', NULL, '3500.00', '2025-08-22 16:08:39', '2025-08-22 16:08:39', 5, 6, '<div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div>• Shirt Fabric: Fleece</div><div>• Pattern: Plain</div><div>• Neck Type: Collared</div><div>• Available Sizes: Standard Size</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 1 Pc</div><div>• Package Includes:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 1 x Coat</div><div>• Color: Beige</div></div></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div><div><br></div>', '<p>Stay cozy and stylish this season with our <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"252\">plain beige fleece coat</strong>. Designed with a <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"295\">classic collared neck</strong> and tailored in <strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"329\">standard size</strong>, this coat is perfect for layering over casual or semi-formal outfits. The <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"427\">soft fleece fabric</strong> ensures warmth and comfort, making it an essential piece for your winter wardrobe.</p>', '<p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/Women\'s%20Stitched%20Plain%20Fleece%20Trench%20Coat%20-%201%20Pc,%20Beige/502354</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
