(118, 'Elegant Patchwork Chiffon Maxi 3-Piece Set – Long Flare Maxi with Dupatta (Peach, Purple, Maroon, Green, Pink, Black)', 'elegant-patchwork-chiffon-maxi-3-piece-set-long-flare-maxi-with-dupatta-peach-purple-maroon-green-pink-black', '3400.00', 'peachpuff,Purple,Red,Green,Pink,Black', '3900.00', '2025-08-23 15:58:58', '2025-08-23 17:44:06', 5, 6, '<blockquote class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">About this item:</span><br></b>• Fabric: Premium Chiffon with Inner (Malai Crepe)<br>• Pattern: Exquisite Embroidery with Lace Work<br>• Neck Type: Classic Round Neck<br>• Number of Pieces: 3 (Maxi + Trouser + Dupatta)<br>• Flare Length: 100 Inches (Grand Ghaira)<br>• Maxi Length: 53–54 Inches<br>• Chest Size: 20–21 Inches<br>• Trouser Length: 38 Inches (Malai Crepe)<br>• Dupatta: 2.5 Yards Chiffon with Four-Sided Lace &amp; Attached Pearls<br>• Elegant embroidery on neck &amp; sleeves<br>• Front &amp; back pearl work for a premium finish<br>• Flowing maxi with extra-wide flare for a royal touch<br>• Matching chiffon dupatta with lace and pearls<br>• Peach – Soft &amp; feminine elegance<br>• Purple – Regal and sophisticated<br>• Maroon – Classic rich appeal<br>• Green – Vibrant and festive look<br>• Pink – Bright and charming<br>• Black – Timeless and versatile<br>Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</blockquote><div><br></div>', '<p data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"585\">Step into elegance with our <strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"357\">luxurious patchwork chiffon maxi 3-piece set</strong>, designed for festive occasions, parties, and weddings. Available in <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"476\">Peach, Purple, Maroon, Green, Pink, and Black</strong>, each piece combines intricate embroidery, lace work, and pearl detailing for a graceful and stylish look.</p><p>\r\n</p><p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"607\">Product Details:</strong><br data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n• Fabric: Premium Chiffon with Inner Attached<br data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\">\r\n• Pattern: Patch Work Embroidery<br data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n• Neck Type: Round Neck<br data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n• Number of Pieces: 3 (Maxi + Trouser + Dupatta)<br data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n• Flare Length: 120 Inches (Extra-wide Ghaira)<br data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n• Maxi Length: 53–54 Inches<br data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n• Chest Size: 20–21 Inches<br data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"878\">\r\n• Trouser Length: 38 Inches (Crepe)<br data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n• Dupatta: 2.5 Yards Chiffon with Lace &amp; Pearl Work</p>', '<p>• Peach – Soft &amp; feminine elegance</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Chiffon%20Patch%20Work%20Maxi%20Suit/626666</p><p>• Purple – Regal and sophisticated</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Chiffon%20Patch%20Work%20Maxi%20Suit/626665</p><p>• Maroon – Classic rich appeal</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Chiffon%20Patch%20Work%20Maxi%20Suit/626663</p><p>• Green – Vibrant and festive look</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Chiffon%20Patch%20Work%20Maxi%20Suit/626662</p><p>• Pink – Bright and charming</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Chiffon%20Patch%20Work%20Maxi%20Suit/626664</p><p>• Black – Timeless and versatile</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Chiffon%20Patch%20Work%20Maxi%20Suit/626661</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
(119, 'Embroidered Katan Silk Lehenga Choli Set with Dupatta & Potli – Wedding & Party Wear', 'embroidered-katan-silk-lehenga-choli-set-with-dupatta-potli-wedding-party-wear', '3400.00', 'Black,Blue,Red,Green,Purple', '3900.00', '2025-08-23 16:56:31', '2025-08-23 17:30:03', 5, 6, '<p class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">About this item:</span><br></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Fabric: Premium Katan Silk / Silk<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Pattern: Elegant Embroidery with Fine Detailing<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Number of Pieces: 2–4 (Depending on Set)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Available Colors: Black, Blue, Maroon, Green<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Package Includes (Varies by Color):<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Black Set (4 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Potli, 1 x Dupatta<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Blue Set (4 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Potli, 1 x Dupatta<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Maroon Set (3 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Dupatta (Chiffon Heavy Border Embroidery, 2.5 Yards)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Green Set (2 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Purple Set (4 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Potli, 1 x Dupatta&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Measurements:<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Shirt Length: 19 Inches<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Shirt Chest: 19 Inches<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Lehenga Length: 38 Inches<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Lehenga Flare: 140–150 Inches (depending on set)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Dupatta: 2.5 Yards (where included)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Design Highlights:<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Exquisite embroidery on Choli &amp; Lehenga<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Flowing silk lehenga with grand flare for a royal look<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Heavy embroidered chiffon dupatta (Maroon set)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Stylish potli bag (included in Black, Blue &amp; Purple sets)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Colors:<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Black – Bold and timeless<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Blue – Elegant and graceful<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Maroon – Rich traditional charm<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Green – Simple and classy<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">• Purple – Regal and luxurious&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Note: There may be a 1–3 cm difference in measurements due to manual sizing, and slight color variations may occur due to lighting and monitor settings.</span></p><div><br></div>', '<h3 data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"120\">🖤 Black Lehenga Choli Set</h3><p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"437\"><strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"137\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"140\">\r\nTurn heads with this elegant black katan silk lehenga choli set. Designed with rich embroidery and paired with a beautifully crafted dupatta and potli, this 4-piece outfit exudes luxury and grace. With a 150-inch flare and premium fabric, it’s the perfect choice for weddings and festive events.</p><hr data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"442\"><h3 data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"475\">💙 Blue Lehenga Choli Set</h3><p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"766\"><strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"492\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"495\">\r\nRadiate charm in this embroidered blue silk lehenga choli set. The 4-piece outfit includes lehenga, choli, potli, and a 2.5-yard dupatta, creating a complete traditional look. With a 140-inch flare and fine embroidery, it’s ideal for formal gatherings and celebrations.</p><hr data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"771\"><h3 data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"806\">❤️ Maroon Lehenga Choli Set</h3><p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"1123\"><strong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"823\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"826\">\r\nMake a royal statement in this maroon katan silk lehenga choli set. Adorned with heavy embroidered borders and paired with a chiffon dupatta, this 3-piece outfit balances elegance with tradition. The 140-inch flare adds grandeur, making it a perfect choice for weddings and cultural festivities.</p><hr data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\"><h3 data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1162\">💚 Green Lehenga Choli Set</h3><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1454\"><strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1179\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\nStep into sophistication with this embroidered green silk lehenga choli set. A stylish 2-piece outfit featuring a choli and lehenga, crafted with delicate embroidery on premium silk. Minimal yet elegant, this set is perfect for receptions, parties, or festive occasions.</p><hr data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"506\"><p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"607\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">💜 <strong data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"197\">Purple Lehenga Choli Set</strong></p><p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n</p><p data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"501\"><strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"217\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"220\">\r\nDrape yourself in royalty with this embroidered purple silk lehenga choli set. A graceful 2-piece outfit featuring a choli and lehenga, designed with intricate embroidery on premium silk. Elegant and timeless, this set is ideal for weddings, festive nights, or special occasions.</p>', '<p>• Black Set (4 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Potli, 1 x Dupatta</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/Stunning%20Black%20Katan%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20with%20Choli%20-%204%20Pcs%20Set/487238</p><p>• Blue Set (4 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Potli, 1 x Dupatta</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/4%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli/469583</p><p>• Maroon Set (3 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli, 1 x Dupatta (Chiffon Heavy Border Embroidery, 2.5 Yards)</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/3%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Katan%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli/460665</p><p>• Green Set (2 Pcs): 1 x Lehenga, 1 x Choli</p><p>https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/4%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Katan%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli/503676</p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL),
(120, 'LuxuriousSilk Lehenga Choli Set - 4 Pcs Embroidered Ensemble', 'luxurioussilk-lehenga-choli-set-4-pcs-embroidered-ensemble', '4700.00', 'Black,Blue,Red,Purple', '5000.00', '2025-08-23 17:14:23', '2025-08-23 17:27:30', 5, 6, '<div><div><h2 class=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">About this item</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">:</span></h2><div><div>•&nbsp; Shirt Fabric: Silk&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>•&nbsp; Pattern: Embroidered&nbsp;</div><div>• Number Of Pieces: 4 Pcs&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Available Sizes: Standard Size&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>•&nbsp; Shirt Length: 21 Inches&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Shirt Chest: 20 Inches&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Skirt Length: 38 Inches&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>• Trouser Length: 38 Inches (Malai Crepe)</div></div></div><div>• Note: There might be an error of 1-3 cm due to manual measurement, and slight color differences may occur as a result of varying lighting and monitor effects.</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div>', '<p data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"729\">Step into timeless elegance with this luxurious purple embroidered silk lehenga choli set. <b>Crafted</b> from premium-quality silk, this 4-piece ensemble is designed to make you stand out at weddings, receptions, and festive occasions. The choli features intricate embroidery work, adding a regal touch to the rich silk fabric. Paired with a flowing embroidered skirt and a matching <b>dupatta</b>, the outfit creates a graceful and traditional silhouette while maintaining modern <b>sophistication</b>.</p><p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"1062\">The lehenga has a <b>flattering</b> flare, while the choli is tailored to provide a comfortable yet stylish fit. The rich purple tone adds depth and royalty to your look, making it a versatile outfit for both day and evening functions. The set also comes with a matching <b>potli</b> bag, completing your ensemble with a chic ethnic accessory.</p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1244\">Whether you’re a <b>bridesmaid</b>, attending a festive gathering, or simply want to make a statement at a celebration, this outfit is a perfect blend of tradition, luxury, and comfort.</p>', '<p><b>black</b></p><p><a href=\"https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/Elegant%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli%20Set%20-%204%20Pcs/567281\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/Elegant%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli%20Set%20-%204%20Pcs/567281</a><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: monospace; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"></span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: monospace; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: monospace; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">blue</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/LuxuriousSilk%20Lehenga%20Choli%20Set%20-%204%20Pcs%20Embroidered%20Ensemble/567267\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/LuxuriousSilk%20Lehenga%20Choli%20Set%20-%204%20Pcs%20Embroidered%20Ensemble/567267</a><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><font face=\"monospace\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"></span></font></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><font face=\"monospace\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">red</span></font></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><font face=\"monospace\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli%20Set%20-%204%20Pcs%20Women\'s%20Stitched%20Ensemble/567280</span></font></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><font face=\"monospace\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">purple</span></font></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><font face=\"monospace\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">https://www.shop.markaz.app/explore/product/Exquisite%20Silk%20Embroidered%20Lehenga%20Choli%20Set%20-%204%20Pcs%20Ensemble/567268</span></font></span></p>', 'in stock', NULL, NULL);
